(7560547, 1211935, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>I didn''t realise that nicey Barbie got up to such naughty things! Great idea Susan, well thought out and I love the title but, as you recognise in your comments its not perfect, lighting being the key issue. But the idea is great, thanks for making me laugh...</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge I didn''t realise that nicey Barbie got up to such naughty things! Great idea Susan, well thought out and I love the title but, as you recognise in your comments its not perfect, lighting being the key issue. But the idea is great, thanks for making me laugh...', '2018-02-23 10:57:00.000000', NULL, 0),
(7560548, 1211612, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>You''ve gone for the ''Ah how cute'' route with your lovely soft toy polar bear with his appealing expression, lovely. I''m not convinced about the lighting, its very blue and very red, I think more subtlety and more white would have perhaps been more successful for you? Anyway, thanks for entering and sharing YaoJun.</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge You''ve gone for the ''Ah how cute'' route with your lovely soft toy polar bear with his appealing expression, lovely. I''m not convinced about the lighting, its very blue and very red, I think more subtlety and more white would have perhaps been more successful for you? Anyway, thanks for entering and sharing YaoJun.', '2018-02-23 11:04:27.000000', NULL, 0),
(7560549, 1211444, 25024, '<td valign="top">Hello from the critique club<br/> <br/>An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge<br/> <br/>Congratulations Marcel, a well deserved ribbon to add to your growing collection. You''ve done an excellent job and created a fun yet convincing composition worthy of your successful result. I like all the background elements, the shallow DOF and lighting it all works well. Perhaps my only criticism are the reflections in his helmet of your pictures hanging on the walls, a consideration for your next home studio set up?</td>', 'Hello from the critique club An appealing image that contributes well to the challenge Congratulations Marcel, a well deserved ribbon to add to your growing collection. You''ve done an excellent job and created a fun yet convincing composition worthy of your successful result. I like all the background elements, the shallow DOF and lighting it all works well. Perhaps my only criticism are the reflections in his helmet of your pictures hanging on the walls, a consideration for your next home studio set up?', '2018-02-23 11:12:25.000000', NULL, 0),
(7560550, 1211897, 135744, '<td valign="top">Very good indeed. Congrats on the blue</td>', 'Very good indeed. Congrats on the blue', '2018-02-23 11:18:22.000000', NULL, 0),
